WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.980
I was just researching 
the ancient documents,

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.960
and I found out that 
Granvania has a labyrinth

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:09.110
other than the twelve
 Labyrinths of Constellations.

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:10.990
Congratulations, Itsuki!

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:14.990
This must be a sign that 
there's also a thirteenth maiden!

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:47.250
A new maiden?

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:53.130
I wonder where she is?

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:55.630
A new maiden?

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:03.680
Not a woman?

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:20.600
Wait a minute! Cool off!

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:21.990
Calm down!

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:25.560
Even if your brain's telling you to 
calm down, your body isn't listening.

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:29.750
The more you try to cool your head,
 the more your body heats up.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:33.500
It's getting maddeningly hot and it 
feels like you're engulfed in flames!

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.600
It's hot here, here, here, 
here, here, and here!

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:41.560
I'm burning up! I can't take it anymore!

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:46.360
Burning!

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:48.600
Crispy margherita!

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:50.460
Oh, if it isn't Itsuki!

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:52.770
What a coincidence.

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:57.930
Ouch.

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:00.280
Better not burn myself.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.290
Dripping sweat.

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:16.050
Twitching muscles.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.170
There's no need for words.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:19.920
Your instincts take over...

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:22.260
as wild breaths blow against you.

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:42.040
Itsuki.

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:43.570
What a coincidence.

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:46.330
I can't stop sweating.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:53.510
See you.

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:12.920
We keep bumping into each other.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:18.730
I'm wet.

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:23.360
Seiya's body wasn't the
 only thing getting wet.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.720
Itsuki was wet, too.

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:29.630
His heart was burning up!

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:31.930
Love confused Itsuki.

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:33.800
This is Granvania,

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:36.380
where the Visitor around 
the corner gets wet...

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:50.090
Wait, this is a public bath for men.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:52.140
It's normal that there's a lot of men here.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.890
Itsuki was unsure of himself.

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:57.230
The smell of men all around him.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:02.900
The fabulous scent caused a marvelous 
feeling to well up inside him.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.210
Rising libido!

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:11.770
Yes, I am now about to 
open the forbidden door...

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:14.100
Even though I'm still hesitant...

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:17.200
I'll let my body take over...

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:21.080
The thirteenth maiden is a man?!

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:23.000
Maybe I can do it!

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:26.930
Enough of your weird narration!

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:35.550
Not so hard!

00:05:35.550 --> 00:05:37.180
I'm starting to become dirty!

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:39.880
So dirty as you get cleaner!

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:39.880
Jeez...

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:41.510
Huh? Itsuki?

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:44.190
I just happened to be here.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:49.480
Maybe this isn't a coincidence anymore.

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:54.330
Not so hard!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.010
I'm starting to become dirty!

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:58.700
So dirty as you get cleaner!

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:03.930
No, if you keep scrubbing me...

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:05.870
I-I-I... no!

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:07.120
I can't take it anymore!

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:09.610
That's... that's... a danger zone!

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:11.990
Maybe it's fate... right?

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:14.380
Fate? Coincidence? Supernatural?!

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:18.410
Want me to wash your back?

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:21.360
Huh? No... Next time.

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:31.490
Why are you staring blankly into space?

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:35.710
You have to find the thirteenth maiden 
and perform a Love Ritual!

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:37.870
Even though I don't know who it is?

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:41.540
He might be closer than you think!

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:43.420
Closer than I think?

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:46.600
Maybe he hasn't realized his destiny yet.

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:49.480
Even if he did, there's no guarantee 
that he would just show up.

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:54.050
No, he must know just how 
important a maiden's duty is!

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:58.400
Hey, can you stop saying 
"him" this and "him" that?

00:06:58.400 --> 00:06:59.370
How come?

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:03.310
Why are you talking as if 
the thirteenth maiden is a man?

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:05.930
What? You're still worrying about that?!

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:09.760
We teased about a Love Ritual between 
two men at the end of the previous episode,

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:12.250
and that's where the story is 
going so far in this episode!

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:14.320
No way! It's a maiden!

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:15.610
How can that be a man?

00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:18.080
You're still stuck on the stereotypes.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.830
You'll never get rid of your old fart smell!

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:24.590
When you've finally finished 
Love Rituals with twelve maidens...

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:28.090
When you've finally bonded 
with the twelve women...

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:33.260
That's when they added the plot twist 
about a thirteenth labyrinth!

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:38.120
This means they're trying to 
stimulate and shock the viewers!

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:39.520
Plot twist?

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.790
Even in sentai or bishoujo series,

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:44.590
you get new allies midway through the season.

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:47.980
{sore ga}It can sometimes even be an enemy 
commander, or an android...

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:48.990
That's trending right now.

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:50.970
The thirteenth maiden being a man...

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:54.200
That's not a stretch for episode 9 material.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.780
You're very well-informed.

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:58.570
I've heard from Narcisstes

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:04.000
that the thirteenth labyrinth has 
been sealed all this time.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:07.370
In other words, it's a forbidden door!

00:08:07.370 --> 00:08:09.040
Don't twist the meaning like that!

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:11.550
Forbidden door! Then...

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.920
<b>Forbidden</b>

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:15.580
could it be anything other 
than a Boys' Love Ritual?

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:17.180
<b>Forbidden</b>

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:16.550
Visually so, as well!

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:18.440
No, no, no way!

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:22.810
Does that mean it'll be 
forbidden in some other way?

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:26.570
Where should we go?

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:29.440
<b>Forbidden</b>

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:28.390
What?!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:33.550
Love Ritual with optional play.

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:34.820
No!

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:35.450
<b>Forbidden</b>

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:38.510
Or sibling love?

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:40.080
Onii-chan, I don't mind.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:40.700
<b>Forbidden</b>

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:43.560
Or stepmother?

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:45.420
Are you sure you're fine with me?

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:47.330
I don't have a little sister or a stepmother!

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:51.030
Are you saying we should 
think outside the box?

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:54.140
Would you like an episode title 
of "Itsuki-kun and horsey"?

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:55.340
Horsey?

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:01.040
Will you go to Sue's farm and find a partner?

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:03.350
Are you going to drive the legal team crazy?

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:05.600
Which one would you like?

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:07.580
You can pick from all the cuties here!

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:08.400
You beast!

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:09.360
Who are you going to have?

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:11.480
Or maybe they'll have you!

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:16.360
No, no way!

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:19.260
What are we going to do, then?

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:20.170
Second round.

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:21.070
Huh?

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:23.820
I'll go for second rounds and 
make the next Star Child.

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:24.920
Second round?

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:26.620
I'll start with Mahiru, again...

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:29.440
This is the second round, 
so I've gained the skills.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.640
I'm pretty confident this time.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:32.810
Huh?!

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:37.260
Men are so simple-minded, don't you think?

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.660
They're maidens, after all.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:41.400
And... women.

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:46.240
But that would still be a second round. 
Not the thirteenth maiden.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:48.900
Reboots are important, 
but we need a new one here!

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.850
But a man?

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:56.880
It feels like I'm betraying 
Mahiru and the others...

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.120
Yeah?

00:09:58.120 --> 00:10:04.660
What's the phrase you've 
said to all of twelve of them?

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:08.520
Please have my child.

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:11.960
I'm despicable!

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:14.710
Don't cry.

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:17.120
Well, I guess you would 
be despicable in Sola,

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:20.970
but in Granvania, those are the 
words that will save the world.{timing check please}

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:25.100
What are you going to do?

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:27.740
Go for horses?

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:28.980
Not horses.

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.980
All right!

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:34.480
I guess this is pretty much it.

00:10:34.890 --> 00:10:37.000
Way too few choices!

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:40.460
How can we introduce a new character now?

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:41.950
That would be too convenient!

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:44.300
It would be more visually 
pleasing with a hottie.

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:45.740
Tasty!

00:10:48.130 --> 00:10:51.240
I mean, are they even...

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:52.000
Huh?

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.750
Well, you know...

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.000
Huh?

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:58.960
Oh! You mean, are they fine 
being with another man?

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:00.480
No!

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:03.600
Maidens have to be chaste, right?

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:07.270
Oh, you mean, are they virgins?

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:11.680
Narcisstes reads ancient documents 
and researches all the time,

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:13.710
so he's probably only had books as partners.

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:16.510
Please, please bind me!

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:18.740
Bind me and put me on a shelf!

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:22.890
Seiya, as you know, is a playboy and 
looks like he's good with women,

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:26.510
but guys like that would never want girls 
to know they're actually inexperienced

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:29.200
and throw away opportunities 
when there's a real chance.

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:31.460
No action for me.

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:35.460
No, the king can't be, right?

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:41.470
You'll know by whether or not he can 
perform the Love Ritual when the time comes.

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:47.390
It feels like you're not trying as hard as 
you did with the other twelve maidens.

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:50.170
That's not true.

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:55.450
Listen! This is all for saving Granvania!

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:58.040
To seal the thirteenth labyrinth!

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:00.410
We need a new Star Child!

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:01.800
There's no time for hesitation—

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.440
But I don't have any feelings for...

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:07.780
I know how you feel, but for the 
peace and future of Granvania...

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:09.260
Itsuki!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.500
I was shooting for a new photo book.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:14.830
Selfies again?

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:16.620
Yeah.

00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:20.090
Anyway, it looks like you're down, Itsuki.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:21.900
Is something bothering you?

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:24.200
I'll be happy to hear you out,
 if you want.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:30.940
Look, your prey has come on his own!

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:39.770
The theme of my next photo book is vampires.

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:41.280
I-I see.

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.320
Come on, you can tell me anything.

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:45.920
<i>What am I supposed to say?</i>

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:46.920
<i>"Are you into guys?"</i>

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:48.990
<i>Or, "are you still a virgin?"</i>

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:51.770
Aren't you thinking too much about others?

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:54.140
<i>No, I can't do it with another guy.</i>

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:57.030
I know how hard it must be for you.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:01.130
You came to Granvania 
from Sola as the Visitor.

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:02.700
You don't know anyone,

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:04.030
nobody to lean on,

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:06.880
and you have to spend your days 
here alone as an outsider.

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:09.640
Actually, Mahiru is a 
childhood friend of mine.

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:12.840
Not only that, you have the 
duty of saving Granvania.

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:16.160
I know the loneliness and 
pressure you must be feeling!

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:17.310
It's the same for me.

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:21.210
They say I'm the number one womanizer 
in the nation, a playboy,

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:23.450
and I have to play my part
 to live up to the girls' expectations.

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:25.900
I have to spend my days 
alone making photo books.

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:27.320
You don't have friends?

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:30.080
This is not the real me!

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:34.410
I got a bit too excited.

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:36.620
<i>Stop it.</i>

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.880
<i>Stop the sad look!</i>

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:42.420
Itsuki, I'm the only one who 
can understand your loneliness.

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:46.470
Let's warm our lonely skins together.

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:47.480
Huh?

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:50.140
<i>Isn't this a bit different from before?</i>

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:52.220
<i>Compared to how it went 
with the maidens before...</i>

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:55.770
<i>Well, all the previous maidens were girls,</i>

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:58.520
<i>so this time is definitely different, but...</i>

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:02.480
<i>Wait a minute, I'm the 
one who's being seduced?</i>

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:05.770
Uh, um...

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:07.070
Are you nervous?

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:08.910
Nervous? More like...

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.410
That's good.

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:12.560
Good? What is?

00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:14.160
Huh? What?

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:17.040
Live together, or just die alone?

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:19.610
Let's change our angle of thinking.

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:26.260
Relax a bit more.

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:29.930
Take two.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:38.550
No...

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:44.190
Wait a second! I need a break!

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.650
You could've stayed the night.

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:51.760
Why did you run out like that?

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:53.450
You were so close!

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:56.200
He was almost on top of me!

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:59.640
If I kept going, I would've 
been the one to give birth!

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:02.410
Who cares who's the one giving birth now?

00:15:02.410 --> 00:15:03.400
I care!

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:04.960
It's with another man!

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.240
Oh, well.

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:08.000
Let's go for the next one!

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:09.470
Next?

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:13.750
Who would've thought you 
would come to see me?

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:19.020
I thought maybe I should learn a 
bit more about the thirteenth labyrinth.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:20.090
Smirk.

00:15:20.090 --> 00:15:21.560
Don't do that.

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:23.720
That's a great attitude.

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:27.290
However, there are still many mysteries

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:30.360
surrounding the thirteenth labyrinth, 
and I'm still researching.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:32.860
I need more time.

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:34.870
Okay, see ya.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.200
Hey, don't just leave!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:38.060
Itsuki.

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:39.390
Uh, yes?

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:41.450
Don't burden yourself too much.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:48.440
The sudden responsibility of shouldering 
the fate of Granvania as the Visitor...

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:52.700
That is probably something 
I will never fully understand.

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:56.760
I am thankful, from bottom of my heart.

00:15:58.510 --> 00:16:00.860
We need you.

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:02.640
Narcisstes...

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.680
I have a question for you.

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:07.320
<b>History</b>

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:07.320
Ancient hieroglyphs are hard to interpret.

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:09.570
I'll help if I can.

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:14.570
M-My body is really stiff,

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:16.250
so I can't do it!

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:20.270
According to ancient documents,

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:24.080
human culture is difficult to understand.

00:16:25.140 --> 00:16:27.180
Stopping right before the action again?!

00:16:27.180 --> 00:16:29.280
Why are you teasing me?

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:32.000
Well, he's still a man.

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:33.610
Why does that bother you so much?

00:16:33.610 --> 00:16:35.590
Just go for it!

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:39.070
It just feels wrong for me.

00:16:39.070 --> 00:16:41.600
I can't abandon my values so easily.

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:45.240
You can easily abandon 
and change your values.

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:49.480
Well, your values must have 
been messed up from the start.

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.990
I used to be an Impurity.

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:54.240
You were an Impurity?

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:59.820
A magician in this nation brought me
 out of a labyrinth a hundred years ago.

00:16:59.820 --> 00:17:02.370
How did they just allow an 
Impurity to roam around free?

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.140
They didn't.

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:07.100
I've been told that the magician was trying 
to give consciousness to Impurities,

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:09.750
and tried to find a way to coexist.

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:16.000
But the magician died before 
he could complete his work.

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:17.260
Leaving me behind...

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:20.350
I was an Impurity who was left behind,

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:22.140
and I was all alone.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:25.140
I was very confused, 
and didn't know what to do.

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:29.260
Not only that, the government 
found out about my existence,

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:31.400
and tried to cleanse me.

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:33.550
Cleanse you, Mana?

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:36.120
Because Impurities shouldn't exist.

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:42.160
But surprisingly, that Visitor 
didn't kill me, and protected me.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:46.510
I have been serving this nation ever since.

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:48.420
That Visitor...

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.460
...is Shangri-La!

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:51.920
What? The king?!

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:53.580
Details on our website!

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:54.420
<b>"Check the {red}official website {black}for details!"</b>

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:54.420
Hey!

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:55.980
Got it?

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:59.450
You can change yourself very easily.

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:02.400
It's not that bad for you.

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:05.280
As a Visitor, you're welcomed by everyone.

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:07.440
But as a former Impurity,

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:11.180
I shouldn't even be allowed to exist here.

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:15.110
Sometimes I hate myself... My tainted body...

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:16.690
Itsuki?

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:20.450
Don't blame it on yourself like that.

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:22.580
Itsuki...

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:25.770
It must be hard for you.

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:30.330
You sexual beast!

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:35.340
I think I've just broken a barrier.

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:37.590
Mana, I think I can do it.

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:41.260
The more you resist, the more you want it.{actually, this line is pretty much "no means yes"}

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:44.600
Please be gentle.

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:49.240
Hey, Itsuki!

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:51.860
You've shamed me!

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:53.800
If I can do Mana...

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:56.110
If I can do Mana, I...

00:18:57.270 --> 00:18:58.610
Itsuki?

00:18:58.970 --> 00:19:01.310
I can also do men!

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:04.030
...men! ...men! ...men! ...men!

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:06.540
Also? Also men?

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:10.990
Men and women... I want to break 
that barrier and get past it!

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:12.960
I want to save Granvania!

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:14.980
Well said, Itsuki!

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:19.870
I've prepared a room for the two of you!

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:20.620
Huh?

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:22.350
I called Seiya, too.

00:19:22.350 --> 00:19:23.680
Come, come, come!

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:26.620
I understand the situation.

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:30.060
The thirteenth maiden is a man, huh?

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:33.240
You will have my child?

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:34.670
Hold on, Itsuki.

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:37.050
What? Wait for what?

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:39.320
I will no longer wait for anything!

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:41.320
Who would you pick?

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:46.580
Yes. Who would you pick as the thirteenth maiden?

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:48.990
Both of you.

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:49.900
Huh?

00:19:49.900 --> 00:19:53.230
I don't care about men or women, 
or the thirteenth or whatever.

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:56.330
You're both the important thirteenth maiden.

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:58.730
I want the three of us to save Granvania!

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:01.410
Unless you don't want to.

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:03.000
That's not fair, Itsuki.

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:09.200
Sheesh, we can't complain 
when you say it so sincerely.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:11.160
But that sincerity...

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:12.770
is what's good about you.

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:16.090
So you will have my child?

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:18.570
Will we be able to?

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:21.300
Don't worry, just do it.

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:23.400
Let's do it.

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:25.160
Let us do it.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:28.160
Open, forbidden door!

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:33.550
Wonderful!

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:42.030
That was a sight to behold.

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:43.200
So very interesting!

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:45.640
Mana, neither of them was the one?

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:47.450
Of course not!

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:52.100
How can there be a Love Ritual 
between men?

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:55.640
Are you telling me you were playing me?!

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:57.560
That's not it, Itsuki!

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:00.110
You have now leveled up!

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.470
Leveled up?

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:05.800
For you humans, the more 
open-minded, the better.

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:07.630
Open-minded?

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:09.930
I knew about this from the start.

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:11.040
You did?

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:14.790
Now, you can love the thirteenth 
maiden with fresh feelings.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:16.940
Fresh feelings...

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:19.640
I mean, you can even do men!

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:23.120
You seem stronger than yesterday.

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:25.550
We're counting on you for 
the future of Granvania.

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:28.500
It's not fair that you've known all along.

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:31.450
I was serious, though.

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:43.940
<i>Not just with women</i>

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:45.740
<i>or with men.</i>

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:48.220
<i>It's about having feelings for each other</i>

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:51.240
<i>that will become an irreplaceable bond.</i>

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:53.050
<i>Whether you prefer women</i>

00:21:53.050 --> 00:21:54.200
<i>or men,</i>

00:21:54.630 --> 00:21:56.200
<i>I'm sure that you, too,</i>

00:21:56.200 --> 00:21:58.940
<i>are a Visitor for someone out there.</i>

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:59.960
<b>Let's Try Giving Birth, Together</b>

00:23:32.510 --> 00:23:39.980
My Children, Thirteen of them!?

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:39.980
Mole on your tushie.
